{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ara and Shea were once the same height. Since then Shea has grown 20% while Ara has grown half as many inches as Shea. Shea is now 60 inches tall. How tall, in inches, is Ara now?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7674eb3fc85b9185ab0c59486ed039399619c624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 51 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 52 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 54 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Shea has grown <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, if x was her original height, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/6147046220a96bdd4b4e5e7f8f5b3aff8fc7bab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2x = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />, so she was originally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83e819ebc35710609b23eff174fab0cbb952454d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{1.2}=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" /> inches tall which is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0429864b246b746403fe1ee5efeb8905e4fb4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 - 50 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> inch increase.  Ara also started off at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches.  Since Ara grew half as much as Shea, Ara grew <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/4/314fdcb4961fb4354574f623c207e720818eb56a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> inches.  Therefore, Ara is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4db9feb6b5a20cc7f2583955e2486130ce1f4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50+5=55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" /> inches tall which is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/130156bdc5588c66a9d69e18887ac367b9c41bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.a